                             INTRODUCTION

         Our organization was founded back in 2011 as a software
company named “GENNETEX” or Generation of Network Experts.

         We have been operating in the fields of communication
network, infrastructure installations, repair and maintenance
services since the establishment of the company without interruption.

         In order to keep pace with the global development, our
primary goal has become to provide the most optimal internet
infrastructure solutions in the Information Technology (IT) era.
Accordingly we have been cooperating with outstanding national
ISP companies for introducing high speed internet services and IPTV
technology throughout Mongolia.

         In addition, we supply fiber optic cable, remote control
cameras and relevant accessories upon order.

         The company employs skillful and sophisticated workers
eager to do a lot for the prosperity and development of our
motherland, combining the software with the hardware.

