                          WORK EXPERIENCES

         The principal business partner of our company is “Unitel” group,
one of the largest ICT companies in Mongolia and we have been
cooperating with this company since 2012 in our 6th year without
interruption.

         During the past years, over 60 companies and organizations,
which are licensed to run communication network and infrastructure
installation and repair services, have cooperated with “Univision” LLC.
Thanks to our quality performance, “Unitel” Group still maintains friendly
cooperation with our company since the colleagues of the company are
evaluated and considered as diligent, honest and reliable partners.

         Besides performing the installation of local cables and fiber optic
cables of “Univision” LLC in new apartments and buildings, we provide
relevant repair and maintenance services for the old customers in due
course. In addition, we have shown that the colleagues of “GENNETEX”
company are skillful and able to work in any condition by performing fiber
optic cable extensions, installations of OLT and UPS devices and
antennas, as well as installation of communication cable lines of the
organization.

         The company's colleagues have the experience of providing
installations of external and internal IP based networks of Univision
Company for over 10000 households and about 1000 organizations in
Ulaanbaatar city and 3000 households in Darkhan city and 6000
households in other local areas in a timely manner with quality
performance.

